; output_slot_out_of_range: OUTPUT to a slot beyond the allocated count
; must raise OutputIndex.
;
; inputs.json allocates 4 slots; this writes slot 8. A VM that stored
; outputs in an unbounded map would complete silently, so a program that
; wrote past its allocation would look fine.

PUSH 42
STOW r0
PUSH 8
OUTPUT r0
HALT
